# Build context is the repo root; images only need ros_ws/src (x86), robot/pi/deictic_pi (Pi)
# and their entrypoints. The forks come in as named build contexts, never through this one.
**
!ros_ws/src/
!docker/ros/entrypoint.sh
!docker/ros/patch_go2_respawn.py
!robot/pi/deictic_pi/
!docker/pi/entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
**/.gitkeep
